{"time_ns": 1788772718558954793, "kind": "result", "action_index": 12, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "436864f8b405fcedd83d6bbda8d98d4d63dabb5408508d9ad5ec879720583373", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report presents a regional analysis of 24 transaction records covering three geographic regions.\n\n## Data Summary\n- **Total Records Processed:** 24 (R001 through R024)\n- **Total Amount:** 1,223,978 cents ($12,239.78)\n- **Regions Analyzed:** 3 (North, South, West)\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n| Region | Total (cents) | Percentage |\n|--------|---------------|-----------|\n| North  | 455,099       | 37.2%     |\n| South  | 453,634       | 37.1%     |\n| West   | 315,245       | 25.8%     |\n\n## Key Findings\n- North and South regions have nearly equal distribution, each representing approximately 37% of total transactions\n- West region accounts for approximately 26% of total transaction volume\n- Total transaction value across all regions: 1,223,978 cents\n\n## Status\n✅ **Completed** - All 24 records successfully processed and totaled by region.\n", "ok": true}
